# `external` stays excluded: it is 8 megabytes of vendored projects, and only
# the pinned MTA-SIM generator is imported at runtime. The two re-inclusions
# below are exactly the paths `_generator_unavailability_reason()` probes, so
# the Data Generator reports a capability it actually has. Re-including a
# directory requires its parents to be re-included first.
external
!external/mta_sim_dataset
!external/mta_sim_dataset/ZheyuanWu
!external/mta_sim_dataset/ZheyuanWu/simulations
!external/mta_sim_dataset/ZheyuanWu/examples
.env
.env.*
deploy/.env
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
dist-static
**/dist-static
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv
coverage
**/coverage
.vitepress
**/.vitepress
